==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**24,300 grants +3 Gold Z.
**24,400 grants +3 Meteorite Z.
**24,500 grants +3 Beast Bones Z.
*Added the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]] content from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] to international versions.
*Replaced the Trait and Rank drop-down lists in the [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] Storage with a Filter button. The Talent Orb Filter has a similar UI to the [[Cat Filter]], with options to filter by Rank, Target and Effect.
*Added placeholder sprites for a new Talent Orb trait and 6 new Talent Orb effects.
*Added 1 placeholder enemy.
*Raised [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]] and [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]]'s + level caps from +45 to +50.
*Raised [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]]'s + level cap from +35 to +40.
*Changed [[Ackey]]'s attack timings so he hits at 32f, 52f, 72f rather than 32f, 38f, 44f.
*Reworked [[Killer Axe Cat Base (Enemy Base)|Killer Axe Cat Base]] to have a decreased attack rate and hit at 0~500 range, 750~1,250 range and 1,500~2,000 range.
